      "notes": "MacOS agent_dir default /usr/local/var/db/newrelic-infra (Homebrew Apple Silicon often /opt/homebrew/var/db/...). Inventory cache under data/; logging plugin bits under newrelic-integrations/logging. Prefer clearing logs/tmp/data only; leave integrations binaries. Stop newrelic-infra first."
    },
